{"title":"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(similar_to_solution_2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (similar to solution 2)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangular</a> piece of paper measures 4 units by 5 units. Several <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">lines</a> are drawn <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Parallel\" title=\"Parallel\">parallel</a> to the edges of the paper. A rectangle determined by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intersection\" title=\"Intersection\">intersections</a> of some of these lines is called <i>basic</i> if \n</p>\n<dl><dd>(i) all four sides of the rectangle are segments of drawn line segments, and</dd>\n<dd>(ii) no <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Segment\" title=\"Segment\">segments</a> of drawn lines lie inside the rectangle.</dd></dl>\n<p>Given that the total length of all lines drawn is exactly 2007 units, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the maximum possible number of basic rectangles determined. Find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder\" title=\"Remainder\">remainder</a> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by 1000.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Denote the number of horizontal lines drawn as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and the number of vertical lines drawn as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. The number of basic rectangles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c30a232f4b89fd7223148d0b70633e8a2dd1d67b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 1)(y - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/ddef3a3fb41a7a510751a819e53cfb8b0bad06e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x + 4y = 2007 \\Longrightarrow y = \\frac{2007 - 5x}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"274\" height=\"38\" />. Substituting, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/339b7e851591c93c428a1d88bdac369990173f83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 1)\\left(-\\frac 54x + \\frac{2003}4\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"181\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FOIL\" title=\"FOIL\">FOIL</a> this to get a quadratic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a1c9dd0da6498a52b9d55a42ff4d4318105411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac 54x^2 + 502x - \\frac{2003}4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"165\" height=\"38\" />. Use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/5/b250a7d94be19932d73b6f79e32ec07dbb15e390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-b}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"24\" height=\"37\" /> to find the maximum possible value of the quadratic: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/e/bde039d8f4a9fe1686bb525008284102b027a4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-502}{-2 \\cdot \\frac 54} = \\frac{1004}5 \\approx 201$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"200\" height=\"44\" />. However, this gives a non-integral answer for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. The closest two values that work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547efddd03211201d08af26a3963f747c05c3bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(199,253)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/4/124d895507ca24ab8583f487179d14747c73ebc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(203,248)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e391e1394ad59c0d4d34d204b762d57539a7fba9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$252 \\cdot 198 = 49896 &gt; 202 \\cdot 247 = 49894$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"298\" height=\"13\" />. The solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/2/5121855c67142bc46660638eafc0eb0345d6f661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{896}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We realize that drawing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> vertical lines and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> horizontal lines, the number of basic rectangles we have is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30acb35b693ea1710acbd9ace236b4a66ac88bdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(y-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />. The easiest possible case to see is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/472004076edfc8b47b0f4e9b7cfb4af70104bec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$223$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> vertical and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/472004076edfc8b47b0f4e9b7cfb4af70104bec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$223$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> horizontal lines, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee9e0cb74c137d9e7deeb63cff767645e6692ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4+5)223 = 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. Now, for every 4 vertical lines you take away, you can add 5 horizontal lines, so you basically have the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/6/f46694b8bf63d2e2685ee01012e5cb26db9b8002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(222-4x)(222+5x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" /> maximize. \n</p><p>Expanded, this gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/2573246659ad9d9d2163c6ed95a9e5808678266d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20x^{2}+222x+222^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"165\" height=\"16\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d743c434bc99610c1d2c89c318b57ecf38ab720c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{b}{2a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"35\" height=\"37\" /> you get that the vertex is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51d77760b487cd9243129186de4b2fbeca7b1b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{111}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />. This is not an integer though, so you see that when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c80ea5862b45877f08d698a0c893bd2806a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, you have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352fd6e583bd4c979c590a742acbbf9d315d0366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20*25+222*5+222^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" /> and that when x=6, you have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a3217acd8d8f144a218f3d0acb5e8cf39d8e43b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20*36+222*6+222^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d9b6897cde1726e450f6160e9e16896ff2edaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222 &gt; 20*11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />, so the maximum integral value for x occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd92d02476c3434bf645bf5a3bc249eca83d3c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. Now you just evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa2b8bc53dd1d4d29f468aa63063e062904ee8d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20*36+222*6+222^{2}\\mod 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"292\" height=\"18\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad74d39d2eb988509469acfaa5f11f5dec9302a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${896}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28similar_to_solution_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(similar_to_solution_2)\">Solution 3 (similar to solution 2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (similar to solution 2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Similar to solution 2, we need to maximise the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30acb35b693ea1710acbd9ace236b4a66ac88bdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(y-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />. Starting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/9/299bc8de57a9dd91cf34b063e5f66f82bd91e589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=223$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />, we simply do trial and error, adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> while subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> each time. We notice that the total number of basic squares increases as we increase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p>Thus, we simply need to find the first value for which the number of basic squares decrease or stay unchanged when we increase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, which occurs at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55b2b3c3b523d72cb65969e1edfdb7d9d80b10eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=258$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45b54a27cea89d648672aa2a582f0ce51bda4bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=195$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />, for which the total number of basic squares is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b28dcfc935d87e4f61995a591e06bc20b4f78b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49,858$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />, which is less than when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e1076c7d4ffea01ec2cfaa096674991b31c98b96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=253$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f4e8f7cad50b53ac2a242bc41175bd61bc87f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=199$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />, which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e424e842783c6c118cb2c10d412733673faf952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49896$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/d/47d8a27786eef7524839c7cc8361f4d1b052cfc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49896\\mod1000 = \\boxed{896}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"199\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wofmtnOkpro?si=_gcBKGGlB5LKUPCd\">2007 AIME II #8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathproblemsolvingskills.wordpress.com/\">MathProblemSolvingSkills.com</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II\" title=\"2007 AIME II\">2007 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017212618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 329/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8532/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.468      1 -total\n 62.14%    8.991      1 Template:AIME_box\n 35.81%    5.181      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4809:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017212618 and revision id 281793. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}